    "module_loading": "Load the exact source entrypoint under a disposable fixture-only package namespace with importlib. Use empty namespace parents instead of production __init__.py. Load only constants.py and hosts/codex/commands.py as leaf modules; substitute inert cli.runtime and hooks.codex_session_start modules before invoking run_hook.",
