      "factory": "Append runtime.build. The fixed inherited kwargs are host=codex, hook_only=True, workspace=None.",
      "compact_restore": "forbidden must remain uncalled; none returns None; response returns synthetic_compact_response. Append compact.restore and check raw identity plus decision_point_mode=True."
